rum.theonyxpath.com/member/2179-lokiravenspeak","name":"LokiRavenSpeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1117"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-16T22:43:24-07:00","id":199698,"title":"","content":"Ok, When i was younger i had a friend named Logan. He was thinking about quitting the ST business and wanted to leave a &quot;Legacy.&quot; (Remember kids, You never quit. you only get better or worse.) So he came to me and offered to teach me everything he knew about WtA, i said &quot;No thanks. ain my coup of tea, ill stuck with DtF and HtR&quot; and he was like &quot;ok.&quot; soon after he took two friends under his wing, from which then he gave all his books and annotations to one of them.<br /> <br /> One day im haging out with my friend (His aprentice) and my friend has a shit ton of werewolf the apocalypse books Including what we called &quot;The Bible.&quot; (logan had the brilliant idea of taking a bunch of trades of WtF and glue them to one book which you needed a key to open, and it had a like 5 books inside it, we theorized that you could keep someone with the book or stop a small caliber bullet).<br /> Between the pages of The Bible, Logan had written notes about characters, systems, strategies and such. I was reading some comic and i see my friend Studying The Bible of WtA, suddenly he burst laughing and i go like &quot;Dude what?&quot; , i get closer to Efe and he shows me some of his annotations, Logan had a very poor handwrite so. he shows me a word that resembled to &quot;Chinos.&quot; (Spanish for Chinesse), and after reading the Paragraph on its full, i realize he meant Crynos (The werewolf battle form). So, ever since then we play WereChinesse (or Hombre Chino), or whenever a player wishes to go onto its &quot;Battleform.&quot; he claims &quot;I Turn into a Chino!&quot; (Me transformo en Chino)<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr clas